    "description": {
      "en": "Original Anomalocaris-inspired tapered flexible marine swimmer with overlapping lateral flaps, paired curved frontal appendages and stalked eyes, three pairs of upturned tail blades and a simplified three-plate ventral oral cone. No broad horseshoe head shield or recolored earlier radiodont mesh. Spine/teeth counts and static pose artistic; no predation animation. Nominal length refers to the tapered body, excluding appendage/fan display extremes.",
